    "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, English<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201c&quot;KunKun dream Startles the Soul&quot; is a multiplayer online game that combines horror and comedy elements. Players need to solve puzzles and escape in a dream full of ghost creatures. The game supports 1 to 4 players and has various maps and special props, but there are some technical problems at this stage, such as inconvenient volume control and online delay, which affect the game experience. I hope the production team will work hard in the later stage and fix the problems so as not to disappoint the expectations of IKUNs. It is tested that the TDP above 10W can be played smoothly.\u201d<br>8\u5206 \u2013 GPD\u638c\u673a<br><br>\u201cGame name: &quot;KunKun dream Startles the Soul&quot; It is a very good game with simple operation, but the operation prompt only appears once. I was so impatient that I quickly clicked to close it, but when I looked for the operation again, I couldn't find it, so I could only figure it out by myself. The operation method is also very simple. You can move the up, down, left, and right keys and press the space bar to draw a line. The pictures will be displayed in the place surrounded by the lines. You can pass the level when the pictures reach a certain area. The characters have rich expressions, divided into two scenes of day and night, which can give you a very good game experience, and the process is too short. Overall, it is worth playing.\u201d<br>\u63a8\u8350 \u2013 \u4e0d\u592a\u6b63\u7ecf\u5c0f\u793e<br>",
